  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 375 degrees Fahrenheit.",
    "In a large bowl, mix together the goats cheese, olive oil, onion, garlic, ginger, cumin, coriander, cayenne pepper, salt, and black pepper.",
    "Transfer the mixture to a baking dish and bake for 20 minutes.",
    "Remove the dish from the oven and stir in the chicken broth.",
    "Return the dish to the oven and bake for an additional 10 minutes.",
    "Remove the dish from the oven and let it cool for a few minutes.",
    "Serve the tagine hot, garnished with fresh herbs if desired.",
    "Ensure poultry is cooked to an internal temperature of 74°C / 165°F (juices run clear, no pink remaining) before serving."
